{"suttaId":"tha-ap502","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2846,2876],"vripara":"104"},"segments":{"tha-ap502:0.3":"Piyālaphaladāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap502:1.1":"“Migaluddo pure āsiṃ, vipine vicaraṃ tadā;","tha-ap502:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, sabbadhammāna pāraguṃ.","tha-ap502:2.1":"“Piyālaphalamādāya, buddhaseṭṭhassadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap502:2.3":"Puññakkhettassa vīrassa, pasanno sehi pāṇibhi.","tha-ap502:3.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap502:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap502:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap502:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap502:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap502:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā piyālaphaladāyako thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap502:8.1":"Piyālaphaladāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap502:8.2":"Kiṅkaṇipupphavaggo paññāsamo.","tha-ap502:9.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap502:10.1":"Kiṅkaṇī paṃsukūlañca, koraṇḍamatha kiṃsukaṃ;","tha-ap502:10.3":"Upaḍḍhadussī ghatado, udakaṃ thūpakārako.","tha-ap502:11.1":"Naḷakārī ca navamo, piyālaphaladāyako;","tha-ap502:11.3":"Satamekañca gāthānaṃ, navakañca taduttari.","tha-ap502:12.1":"Atha vagguddānaṃ –","tha-ap502:13.1":"Metteyyavaggo bhaddāli, sakiṃsammajjakopi ca;","tha-ap502:13.3":"Ekavihārī vibhītakī, jagatī sālapupphiyo.","tha-ap502:14.1":"Naḷāgāraṃ paṃsukūlaṃ, kiṅkaṇipupphiyo tathā;","tha-ap502:14.3":"Asīti dve ca gāthāyo, catuddasasatāni ca.","tha-ap502:15.1":"Metteyyavaggadasakaṃ.","tha-ap502:16.1":"Pañcamasatakaṃ samattaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
